02:12:21.515 --> 02:12:25.141
a democracy is a government for the people,

02:12:25.189 --> 02:12:28.253
by the people, and we are in a democratic republic

02:12:28.317 --> 02:12:30.900
where we vote for representatives who represent the majority.

02:12:31.558 --> 02:12:34.718
