02:12:34.831 --> 02:12:38.504
do what you want to do— no, remember that the majority of the people

02:12:39.004 --> 02:12:42.439
are why we have this government and why you're all sitting where you are,

02:12:42.455 --> 02:12:45.282
because the majority of us voted for you. Um,

02:12:46.229 --> 02:12:49.859
and I guess my other really quick comment before I head out the door was

02:12:49.907 --> 02:12:53.874
